WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
Next, which cloud.

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:07.133
For a GCC tenant like this estate's, every
call goes to the worldwide Graph host,

3
00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:10.351
and sign-in goes to the
worldwide login page.

4
00:00:10.351 --> 00:00:15.824
Every PIM for Groups API page the chapter
read lists the global service that

5
00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:21.038
G C C uses, and the governance licensing
PIM depends on is available in G C C.

6
00:00:21.038 --> 00:00:26.210
The module never guesses: you name the
cloud on every run, and there's no default.
